<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>Canva AI has evolved from a simple design platform into a comprehensive creative suite powered by artificial intelligence. With Magic Studio, Canva integrates multiple AI capabilities directly into its familiar drag-and-drop interface, making advanced design automation accessible to everyone from social media managers to professional designers.</p>
<p>What distinguishes Canva AI is its ecosystem approach. Rather than being a standalone image generator, it combines text-to-image, background removal, photo editing, content writing, and presentation design into one unified platform. With over 135 million users and 610,000+ templates, Canva offers the perfect balance of AI power and design simplicity.</p>
